            "As sister cities, Rhinebeck, New York, and Larreynago, Nicaragua, have engaged in cultural exchange and partnerships since 1989.",
            "Larreyna, which became a sister city–or \"twin town\"-to Rhinebeck, New York, is located in Nicaragua.",
            "Despite their distance from each other, the sister cities of Rhinebeck, New York, and Larreyna Nicaragua have enjoyed the same partnerships as many other sister cities"
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is B (Answer Key: Topic 4, Q3). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Writing real exam compilation."
        },
