          "skill": "Rhetorical Synthesis",
          "domain": "Expression of Ideas",
          "focus": "Synthesize information from research notes to accomplish a specific rhetorical goal for a given audience",
          "source": "SAToplam 2.0 Writing · Topic 4 · Q4",
          "passageTitle": "Rhetorical Synthesis — Q4",
          "passage": "While researching a topic, a student has taken the following notes:\n• In a 2011 study, Loydi tested the effect of plant litter on seeding emergence in a grassland setting.\n• Plant litter includes dead leaves and other plant material.\n• The test site was a mesic grassland in Argentina.\n• It was in a subtropic climate with year-round rain.\n• The researcher found that in these environmental conditions, the presence of plant litter had a neutral effect on seeding emergence.",
