          "domain": "Expression of Ideas",
          "focus": "Synthesize information from research notes to accomplish a specific rhetorical goal for a given audience",
          "source": "SAToplam 2.0 Writing · Topic 4 · Q5",
          "passageTitle": "Rhetorical Synthesis — Q5",
          "passage": "While researching a topic, a student has taken the following notes:\n• Trans Siberrean Orchestra (OTS) is a band from US that was created in 1996.\n• The band's sound combines the genres of hard rock and classical music, with an epic assembly of nearly fifty musicians that includes over a dozen singers.\n• Musicians are regularly invited to perform with OTS on tour.\n• Keyboardist Paul Morris toured with OTS in 2000.\n• Electric violinist Alison toured with OTS in 2008.",
          "prompt": "Which choice most effectively uses information from the given sentences to emphasize the role Paul Morris played when performing with OTS?",
