          "passageTitle": "Rhetorical Synthesis — Q37",
          "passage": "While researching a topic, a student has taken the following notes:\n• Dinosaur fossil specimens can be found at science museums all over the world.\n• A dinosaur fossil specimen nicknamed Jane is housed at the Burpee Museum of Natural History and Culture in Rockford, Minois.\n• Jane, a Tyrannosaurus, lived in the Late Cretaceous period.\n• A dinosaur fossil specimen nicknamed Fafnir is housed at the Science Museum of Minnesota in Saint Paul, Minnesota.\n• Fafnir, a Triceratops, lived in the Late Cretaceous period.",
