          "passage": "While researching a topic, a student has taken the following notes:\n• Understanding the history of science is critical for understanding how knowledge evolves.\n• Anna Vickers was a French algologist born in 1852.\n• She is known for her research on algae in the Canary Islands.\n• Margaret Crosfield was a British geologist born in 1859.\n• She is known for her research on the hills of Northeast Wales.",
